12
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:31,392
So I built the opposite: one slow decision a day.

13
00:00:31,442 --> 00:00:33,444
Price above its moving averages?

14
00:00:33,494 --> 00:00:35,624
Hold more of the coin. Below them?

15
00:00:35,674 --> 00:00:36,650
Wait in dollars.

16
00:00:37,450 --> 00:00:40,353
After the daily close, the bot computes the signal,

17
00:00:40,403 --> 00:00:41,511
