21
00:00:50,726 --> 00:00:54,060
Block time can't be backdated, so anyone can check it.

22
00:00:54,110 --> 00:00:55,000
Devnet for now.

23
00:00:55,800 --> 00:00:59,340
Backtested on Bitcoin and Ethereum since twenty eighteen,

24
00:00:59,390 --> 00:01:01,607
